==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1.33~6 seconds<sup>40f~180f</sup>.
*3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*50 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[SSS Monkey King (Enemy)|SSS Monkey King]] (600%) spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Squire Rel]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
**5 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~2 seconds<sup>2f~60f</sup>.
**100 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**100 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
**10 [[Squire Rel]]s (1,000%) spawn, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
**6 [[Squire Rel]]s (1,000%) spawn, delay 0.07~2 seconds<sup>2f~60f</sup>.
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns.
**1 [[SSS Monkey King (Enemy)|SSS Monkey King]] (500%) spawns.

==Strategy==
There are two very buffed Monkey Kings in this level, so be careful as they can push pretty hard, along with all the other peons in this level. The Master A. is very weak so there is no reason to worry about him. [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] or [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] are great AOE attackers for this stage.

